bg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",12.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_140","I installed a music box inside the base. Wind it up, and it'll start playing music. Doesn't it sound lovely?==W== And the dolls in the center are you and me.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_050"],["say","avg3_221",":] Sparkla and Rabbit Pie. Understood.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Cute, right? This is the scene I always imagined of us going on adventures together~",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_049"],["say","avg1_140","Ever since I was little, I dreamed of having an adorable best friend who would leap right out of a fairy tale book and invite me on exciting adventures.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Someone who would always stay by my side ...==W== so I'd never have to feel the loneliness of being left all alone again.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_140","I kept wishing for that ... until exactly one year ago today.==W== The moment you were born, every dream I ever had about friendship finally came true.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Happy birthday, my most important friend.",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_048"],["say","avg1_140","This is a birthday gift filled with all my gratitude and affection for you... And a proof of our friendship!",9,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_054"],["say","avg3_221",":] Proof ...==W== of friendship?",9,""],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_140","Hehe. It's okay if you don't understand yet. I believe ...==W== someday, you definitely will.",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_140","From now on, I'm counting on you too, Rabbit Pie. We're going to experience all kinds of adventures together.",9,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["end"]]}